{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","settings":{"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":28}},"d02ffd97-30d8-4d01-84ac-941458b9f435":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"3499d534-6d42-4535-925b-5e99a5aa7b1d":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"2014","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"template--16045625671837__d02ffd97-30d8-4d01-84ac-941458b9f435-167796117850526cb7-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Primera Impresora","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16045625671837__d02ffd97-30d8-4d01-84ac-941458b9f435-167796117850526cb7-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Muestra de la primera impresora 3D hecha en la Universidad de Santiago de chile, la impresora 3D que acompaña a Sebastian Sanhueza es la primera versión de varias que le continuaron.<\/p><p>Esto fue presentado en el congreso de Biotecnologia del 2014, Usach.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["3499d534-6d42-4535-925b-5e99a5aa7b1d","template--16045625671837__d02ffd97-30d8-4d01-84ac-941458b9f435-167796117850526cb7-0","template--16045625671837__d02ffd97-30d8-4d01-84ac-941458b9f435-167796117850526cb7-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Primera_Impresora_3D_Crea_en_3D_Print3x.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"3d5ab297-5c73-40fd-9a73-911e5f28e8c5":{"type":"video","settings":{"heading":"Aparición de Crea en 3D (después se llamaría Print3x) en Mini Documental sobre impresión 3D en Chile","heading_size":"h2","enable_video_looping":false,"video_url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=xRHSvi9GFfE","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Desafio_pais.jpg","description":"Aparición de Print3x (anteriormente llamada Crea en 3D) en un minidocumental","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"b9504c5d-f84e-45f6-a043-c21a98a919a1":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"75e94291-04e4-4aa5-9829-b1681bccad91":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"2015","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"60647f8e-9926-4891-8a7e-aa80f5c4097e":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Ganadores del Despega Usach","heading_size":"h2"}},"e284a8ae-f8d1-41e3-b4d5-a6009792d036":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>En esta imagen se muestra al equipo de Crea en 3D (el nombre anterior de la empresa Print3x) cuando reciben el premio por ser uno de los 5 ganadores del concurso de emprendimiento de la universidad.<\/p><p>Miembros de Crea en 3D, de izquierda a derecha, Sebastián Sanhueza, Presentadora, Denis Ogaz, Christopher Casares, Gerson Molina (No está en la foto)<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["75e94291-04e4-4aa5-9829-b1681bccad91","60647f8e-9926-4891-8a7e-aa80f5c4097e","e284a8ae-f8d1-41e3-b4d5-a6009792d036"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Ganadores_despega_usach_Crea_en_3D_Print3x.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"59bbace8-c8c9-4266-97fa-6d1cf6e733b0":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"b157bdf1-5a26-46cd-ac5e-011d43ada31b":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"2016","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"b120ad85-598f-4408-baf6-83f75017e0eb":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Entrega de certificados Stanford","heading_size":"h2"}},"d94d3df2-ad2c-4c86-b3d7-ccb2b98875ac":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Una vez finalizado el curso y concurso nos entregaron los certificados. Se hizo una ronda de inversión, a pesar de no haber conseguido inversión en las rondas de financiamiento, si estuvimos en el podio de los finalistas.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["b157bdf1-5a26-46cd-ac5e-011d43ada31b","b120ad85-598f-4408-baf6-83f75017e0eb","d94d3df2-ad2c-4c86-b3d7-ccb2b98875ac"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Ganadores_en_Stanford_Crea_en_3D_Print3x.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"278ef04d-b971-4641-b3c1-e6e7669f3dcf":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"af6daaff-5f0f-49a1-9192-ae172e0fa398":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"2016","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"ca649da9-7ee2-4b1a-8a40-47739ac3ec1d":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Vuelta a Chile","heading_size":"h2"}},"e01a6abc-5a6f-4b17-87fb-75ceb297b623":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Al volver a Chile tuvimos unas serie de entrevista por la pasantía en Stanford y la vida del emprendimiento en Silicon Valley, además de que tuvimos las casualidad de que el Gerente de innovación de Corfo Tadashi Takaoka estaba en el área, y gracias a los profesores nos juntaron para tener la experiencia de las serendipias del valle del silicio y él también estuvo en la ronda de opinión de los proyectos de los chilenos.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["af6daaff-5f0f-49a1-9192-ae172e0fa398","ca649da9-7ee2-4b1a-8a40-47739ac3ec1d","e01a6abc-5a6f-4b17-87fb-75ceb297b623"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Aparicion_en_el_diario_el_mercurio_Crea_en_3D_Print3x.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"video_3337K4":{"type":"video","name":"t:sections.video.presets.name","settings":{"heading":"Entrevista a Sebastián Sanhueza en la construcción de la Axis One","heading_size":"h2","enable_video_looping":false,"video_url":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/6wg21oH6Pas?si=fXC5L7PXuhrYPWOZ","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/maxresdefault.webp","description":"","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"54d816dc-0a8b-473c-a934-cc21fc246aa7":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"d856084b-307e-4fd5-b3a1-fb5342227e7f":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"2017","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"39e462e8-4982-47f8-8b07-c598b84fc2be":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Entrega de Premios de la nueva version del despega usach","heading_size":"h2"}},"189627e8-eee5-4412-9346-c0d8f38582aa":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Al haber sido ganadores de la versión anterior se nos invito a contar las experiencias de nuestros emprendimientos a las nuevas generaciones de emprendedores de la Universidad de Santiago de Chile. En esa versión Sebastián contaba la historia de Crea en 3D (actualmente Print3x) y los aprendizajes obtenidos en Stanford.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["d856084b-307e-4fd5-b3a1-fb5342227e7f","39e462e8-4982-47f8-8b07-c598b84fc2be","189627e8-eee5-4412-9346-c0d8f38582aa"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Premios_Despega_Usach_Crea_en_3D_Print3x.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"9a7c458d-0b2c-4923-9ca6-29eda9131459":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"70e59033-d7aa-489b-8413-c66e7d40dcbd":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"2018","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"3ae25ee2-bf18-41bc-99bb-cce772321f15":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Ganadores en Waterloo University","heading_size":"h2"}},"6fcf1faa-cb94-4552-882c-d9bdefa192b7":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Al ya haber ganado varios concursos, la Usach nos beco para ir a competir a la aceleradora de negocios de Conrad, en la universidad de Waterloo, Ontario, Canada. Y ¿qué creen? Ganamos el primer lugar frente a más de 50 proyectos internacionales y el apoyo de los inversionistas especializados.<\/p><p><br\/>En el siguiente video se muestra cuando van a dar los ganadores del concuro.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["70e59033-d7aa-489b-8413-c66e7d40dcbd","3ae25ee2-bf18-41bc-99bb-cce772321f15","6fcf1faa-cb94-4552-882c-d9bdefa192b7"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Ganadores_en_Conrad_Waterloo_Crea_en_3D_Print3x.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"e949ce02-6d49-4731-b904-3ed3527387a2":{"type":"video","settings":{"heading":"Print3x gana la competencia en Conrad, Waterloo","heading_size":"h2","enable_video_looping":false,"video_url":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/aMgsiajRdcY","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Print3x_gana_la_competencia_de_Pitch.jpg","description":"Print3x Gana final de pitch en Waterloo, Canada","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"video_W7F7eF":{"type":"video","name":"t:sections.video.presets.name","settings":{"heading":"Entrevista a Sebastián Sanhueza como ganador veterano del despega Usach","heading_size":"h2","enable_video_looping":false,"video_url":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/BgAuIucQkG0?si=TS3oib75ANJ5lxrq","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/maxresdefault_1.webp","description":"","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"1b657d6b-95bf-44fa-ae7c-62714e6c47ab":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--16045625671837__1b657d6b-95bf-44fa-ae7c-62714e6c47ab-167805421102eb6827-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Apariciones en la prensa","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--16045625671837__1b657d6b-95bf-44fa-ae7c-62714e6c47ab-167805421102eb6827-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>2018<\/strong><\/p><p>28 agt <a href=\"https:\/\/portalinnova.cl\/emprendimiento-chileno-impresora-3d-gana-competencia-en-canada\/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Gana competencia en Canadá<\/span><\/a><\/p><p>17agt <a href=\"https:\/\/www.usach.cl\/news\/rector-zolezzi-recibe-estudiantes-viajaron-canada-programa-emprendimiento\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Rector recibe a estudiantes del programa de emprendimiento<\/span><\/a><\/p><p>02agt <a href=\"https:\/\/www.usach.cl\/news\/ganadores-despega-usach-relatan-este-concurso-amplio-sus-horizontes\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ganadores de Despega Usach<\/span><\/a><\/p><p>01jul <a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/feed\/update\/urn:li:activity:6428680955501834240\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Emprendimiento PRINT3X gana jornada en Canada<\/span><\/a><\/p><p>11May <a href=\"https:\/\/portalinnova.cl\/impresora-3d-print3x-maquina-de-fabricacion-chilena-para-materiales-flexibles-o-rigidos\/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Máquina de fabricación chilena para materiales flexibles o rígidos<\/span><\/a><\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>2017<\/strong><\/p><p>16Mar <a href=\"https:\/\/www.usach.cl\/news\/exitoso-termino-del-concurso-estudiantil-despega-usach-transformando-realidades-0\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Exitoso término del concurso Despega Usach<\/span><\/a><\/p><p>16Mar <a href=\"https:\/\/www.usach.cl\/news\/estudiantes-ganadores-despega-usach-destacan-aporte-la-pasantia-estados-unidos-0\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Estudiantes ganadores de Despega Usach destacan<\/span><\/a><\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>2016<\/strong><\/p><p>13Mar <a href=\"http:\/\/proyectosespeciales.emol.com\/clientes\/usach\/pdfs\/01.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Alumnos regresan de pasantía en Stanford<\/span><\/a><\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>2015<\/strong><\/p><p>06Dic <a href=\"http:\/\/impresa.elmercurio.com\/Pages\/NewsDetail.aspx?dt=2015-12-06&PaginaId=11&BodyID=10\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Estudiantes de la universidad realizaran pasantia en Stanford<\/span><\/a><\/p><p>26Abr <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=xRHSvi9GFfE\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=xRHSvi9GFfE\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Mini documental sobre impresión 3D en Chile<\/span><\/a><\/p><p><strong>2014<\/strong><\/p><p>10Nov <a href=\"http:\/\/chile.noticiasabc.com\/2014\/11\/10\/estudiantes-de-la-u-de-santiago-ensamblan-primera-impresora-3d\/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Estudiantes de la U. de Santiago Ensamblan Primera Impresora 3D<\/span><\/a><\/p><p>07Nov <a href=\"https:\/\/www.die.usach.cl\/estudiantes-de-nuestra-casa-de-estudios-son-los-primeros-universitarios-que-ensamblan-impresora-3d\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Estudiantes de nuestra Casa de Estudios son los primeros en impresora 3D<\/span><\/a><\/p><p>06Nov <a href=\"https:\/\/article.wn.com\/view\/2014\/11\/06\/Estudiantes_de_nuestra_Casa_de_Estudios_son_los_primeros_uni\/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Estudiantes son los primeros universitarios que ensamblan impresora 3D<\/span><\/a> <\/p><p>06Nov <a href=\"https:\/\/www.usach.cl\/news\/estudiantes-nuestra-casa-estudios-son-los-primeros-universitarios-ensamblan-impresora-3d\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Usach al día<\/span><\/a> <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--16045625671837__1b657d6b-95bf-44fa-ae7c-62714e6c47ab-167805421102eb6827-0","template--16045625671837__1b657d6b-95bf-44fa-ae7c-62714e6c47ab-167805421102eb6827-1"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}}},"order":["main","d02ffd97-30d8-4d01-84ac-941458b9f435","3d5ab297-5c73-40fd-9a73-911e5f28e8c5","b9504c5d-f84e-45f6-a043-c21a98a919a1","59bbace8-c8c9-4266-97fa-6d1cf6e733b0","278ef04d-b971-4641-b3c1-e6e7669f3dcf","video_3337K4","54d816dc-0a8b-473c-a934-cc21fc246aa7","9a7c458d-0b2c-4923-9ca6-29eda9131459","e949ce02-6d49-4731-b904-3ed3527387a2","video_W7F7eF","1b657d6b-95bf-44fa-ae7c-62714e6c47ab"]}